{"id":"110100-22-42de","year":110,"exam":"110年第二次專門職業及技術人員高等考試牙醫師藥師考試分階段考試（第二階段考試）、醫事檢驗師、醫事放射師、110年專門職業及技術人員高等考試職能治療師、呼吸治療師、獸醫師、助產師考試(第一梯次)","level":"專技高考","subject":"獸醫藥理學","code":"2314","type":"測驗題","fixed":true,"classes":["獸醫師"],"source":"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?t=Q&code=110100&c=314&s=22&q=1","essays":[],"mcq":[{"no":1,"q":"一個pKa為3.4的酸性藥品，在胃部（pH 1.4）和血漿中（pH 7.4）非離子態（unionized form）的比例於平衡時約為多少？","opts":["10000：1","1000：1","100：1","1：1"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":2,"q":"下列有關消化道投藥的敘述，何者正確？","opts":["動物完全無法使用舌下投藥","誘導關閉牛隻的食道溝，會使藥品停留在食道上部","首渡效應常使口服利用率增加","直腸投藥可減少首渡效應的影響"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":3,"q":"偏鹼性藥品在乳汁中的濃度會較其在血中為高的原因為何？","opts":["因脂溶性較高而使得吸收速率較快","因多會被主動運輸（active transport）運送進入","因可和乳汁中的兩價離子結合","因會產生離子捕捉（ion-trapping）的現象"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":4,"q":"下列有關血漿蛋白結合（plasma protein binding）的敘述，何者正確？","opts":["所有sulfonamides的血漿蛋白結合率皆相似","解離常數（dissociation constant）愈小者結合力愈弱","Phenylbutazone與warfarin＿＿＿血漿蛋白結合可相互競爭","Digitoxin主要和球蛋白結合"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":5,"q":"下列有關抑制「酶」與其作用的敘述，何者錯誤？","opts":["抑制cyclooxygenase可抑制前列腺素的合成","抑制phosphodiesterase可增加心臟收縮力","抑制β-lactamase可增加抗黴菌劑的藥效","抑制DNA gyrase可具有殺菌藥效"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":6,"q":"下列何藥品對CYP-450的作用和其他三個藥品不同？","opts":["chloramphenicol","ketoconazole","primidone","cimetidine"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":7,"q":"下列何者是造成犬隻經口投予lidocaine生體可用率（bioavailability）不佳的主因？","opts":["因具有四級銨的結構而降低吸收","因會和食物中的二價離子螯合","因肝臟代謝速率快","因無法經由腎臟再吸收"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":8,"q":"下列何種併用較不會產生藥品不良反應（adverse drug reaction）？","opts":["phenylbutazone與coumarins","furosemide與digitalis","clavulanic acid與amoxicillin","streptomycin與amphotericin B"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":9,"q":"下列何者可以由Henderson-Hasselbalch方程式運算得到？","opts":["藥物於不同pH值水溶液中的解離比率","藥物於不同pH值水溶液中的水解速率","藥物於不同pH值水溶液中的代謝速率","藥物於不同pH值水溶液中的溶解度"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":10,"q":"下列何者是犬隻使用thiopental麻醉作用時間短暫的主要原因？","opts":["藥物很快被腎臟排除","藥物於不同組織間的重分布","藥物很快被肝臟代謝","藥物與血漿蛋白結合比率極高"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":11,"q":"Epinephrine升高血壓的作用與propranolol降低血壓的作用屬於下列何種拮抗？","opts":["受體拮抗（receptor antagonism）","生理拮抗（physiologic antagonism）","化學拮抗（chemical antagonism）","酵素拮抗（enzymatic antagonism）"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":12,"q":"藥物在豬的生物轉化（biotransformation），下列何者較容易被飽和？","opts":["acetylation","amino acid conjugation","sulfate conjugation","glucuronidation"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":13,"q":"下列何者是藥物動力學計算的參數？","opts":["藥物與受體之親和力","藥物之最大生理效應","藥物之相對效價","藥物吸收速率及程度"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":14,"q":"臨床上，diprenorphine適合做為下列那一藥物之拮抗劑？","opts":["diazepam","etorphine","ketamine","xylazine"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":15,"q":"下列有關競爭性神經肌肉阻斷藥物之敘述，何者錯誤？","opts":["Tubocurarine在狗和貓不會引起histamine釋放","Pancuronium引起心跳速率的輕微增加","Atracurium可誘發histamine釋放","Vecuronium具有競爭乙醯膽鹼受器的作用"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":16,"q":"下列何者可作為競爭性神經肌肉阻斷劑中毒的解毒劑？","opts":["MAO inhibitors","acetylcholinesterase inhibitors","COMT inhibitors","COX inhibitors"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":17,"q":"下列何者最適合使用於患有肝、腎疾病動物之麻醉？","opts":["halothane","isoflurane","methoxyflurane","pentobarbital"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":18,"q":"下列何者是蕈毒鹼性致效劑，且投予後可直接與蕈毒鹼性受體結合產生作用？","opts":["neostigmine","echothiophate","hyoscyamine","bethanechol"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":19,"q":"下列何者主要活化β -腎上腺素性受體，藉此舒張支氣管？2","opts":["dobutamine","hyoscyamine","salmeterol","atipamezole"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":20,"q":"下列何者為選擇性β -腎上腺素性受體拮抗劑？1","opts":["albuterol","metaraminol","atenolol","atipamezole"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":21,"q":"下列何者是選擇性的α -腎上腺素性受體致效劑？1","opts":["bretylium","phenoxybenzamine","phenylephrine","prazosin"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":22,"q":"下列何者為臨床經口投予prazosin之主要目的？","opts":["興奮中樞神經系統","鎮靜及鬆弛肌肉","增加心輸出量","促進脂肪分解速率"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":23,"q":"長期使用利尿劑後，常發生低血壓性反射作用而引起心律不整，可併用何種藥物改善？","opts":["α blocker1","α blocker2","β blocker1","β blocker2"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":24,"q":"Enoxaparin對下列何種凝血因子的抑制作用最強？","opts":["II","XI","X","IX"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":25,"q":"下列何者最適合使用於加強鬱血性心衰竭心肌之收縮力量？","opts":["hydralazine","amrinone","nitroglycerin","doxapram"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":26,"q":"下列何者為使用lidocaine抗心律不整之主要作用機制？","opts":["縮短心肌動作電位期間","＿＿＿++阻斷Ca 離子通道","縮短動作電位之不反應期","增加迷走神經之張力"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":27,"q":"下列何者利尿劑因可增加前部遠曲小管鈣的吸收、降低尿鈣的排出，因而可用來治療草酸鈣尿路結石？","opts":["ethacrynic acid","spironolactone","triamterene","hydrochlorothiazide"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":28,"q":"下列藥物何者不具有抗高血鉀症的特性？","opts":["spironolactone","insulin","furosemide","hydrochlorothiazide"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":29,"q":"下列何者兼具利尿和矯正代謝性鹼中毒的作用？","opts":["furosemide","amiloride","acetazolamide","spironolactone"],"ans":"送分","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":30,"q":"下列有關ammonium chloride的作用，何者錯誤？","opts":["酸化尿液","利尿作用","祛痰作用","止吐作用"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":31,"q":"下列影響腸胃功能的藥物中，何者最可能會干擾其他同時口服藥物的吸收？","opts":["cimetidine","misoprostol","omeprazole","sucralfate"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":32,"q":"下列何者具有促進胃黏膜分泌黏液質的作用？","opts":["meclizine","methadone","metoclopramide","misoprostol"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":33,"q":"下列腸胃道用藥中，何者在重複給藥後，會累積於胃壁細胞中？","opts":["misoprostol","omeprazole","ranitidine","sucralfate"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":34,"q":"下列有關metoclopramide止吐作用的敘述，何者正確？","opts":["僅作用於中樞","僅為黏膜保護劑","同時具中樞與周邊作用","僅具制酸作用"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":35,"q":"下列何者是臨床上使用的麻醉性鎮咳藥（narcotic antitussives）？","opts":["meperidine","hydrocodone","noscapine","dextromethorphan"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":36,"q":"下列解充血劑（decongestants），何者不屬於histamine-receptor（H ）antagonists？1","opts":["phenylephrine","dimenhydrinate","chlorpheniramine","hydroxyzine"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":37,"q":"下列何者臨床上屬於鎮咳藥，但不會引起成癮性？","opts":["naloxone","dextromethorphan","meperidine","ipartropium"],"ans":"送分","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":38,"q":"下列藥物何者不具有氣管擴張作用？","opts":["theophylline","propranolol","atropine","isoproterenol"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":39,"q":"下列何者在獸醫臨床上常被用於催產？","opts":["PGD2","PGE2","PGF2α","PGI2"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":40,"q":"下列有關carprofen的敘述，何者錯誤？","opts":["對COX-1之抑制能力比對COX-2之抑制強100倍","可用於犬作為鎮痛及消除炎症之藥物","很少發生胃腸道潰瘍及出血","會增加肝臟及腎臟產生毒性之風險"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":41,"q":"下列何種NSAIDs對cyclooxygenase及lipoxygenase均有抑制作用？","opts":["deracoxib","carprofen","phenybutazone","tepoxalin"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":42,"q":"下列有關aspirin的敘述，何者錯誤？","opts":["對血小板的抑制作用為可逆性","為非選擇性的cyclooxygenase抑制劑","對腹部絞痛之治療不具效應","可被併用於治療敗血症及內毒素性休克重度感染的動物"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":43,"q":"胰島素的分泌會受到下列何者的抑制？","opts":["glucagon","gastrin","epinephrine","secretin"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":44,"q":"下列何者主要透過活化α-腎上腺素性受體，造成平滑肌持久之收縮？","opts":["ergonovine","finasteride","bromocriptine","flumethasone"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":45,"q":"下列何者不屬於抗甲狀腺藥（antithyroid drugs）？","opts":["methimazole","carbimazole","albendazole","propylthiouracil"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":46,"q":"牛產後麻痺與缺乏下列何者有關？","opts":["維生素D","銅","維生素A","生物素"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":47,"q":"當豬隻缺乏維生素A時，下列何種障礙最顯著？","opts":["呼吸作用","繁殖性能","神經傳遞","消化功能"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":48,"q":"下列何藥物可用於治療末期腎臟疾病所導致之貧血？","opts":["ferric sulfate","vitamin K","erythropoietin","vitamin B12"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":49,"q":"Penciclovir以局部（topically）投藥，對下列何種病毒有效？","opts":["herpesvirus","cytomegalovirus","myxovirus","poxvirus"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":50,"q":"下列何者主要是抑制病毒的脫殼（uncoating）？","opts":["zidovudine","amantadine","acyclovir","idoxuridine"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":51,"q":"下列何者在犬隻消化道的吸收較其他三種藥品為佳？","opts":["neomycin","bacitracin","tubocurarine","enrofloxacin"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":52,"q":"下列那一抗微生物藥物不可使用於乳牛之治療？","opts":["nitrofurazone","penicillin G","streptomycin","tetracycline"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":53,"q":"下列那一種磺胺劑可製成中性酸鹼值之鈉鹽製劑而適用於眼科？","opts":["sulfamethazine","sulfacetamide","sulfadimethoxine","sulfachlorpyridazine"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":54,"q":"下列那一種抗微生物之併用組合比較不會誘發細菌抗藥性之形成？","opts":["sulfathiazole-sulfaquinoxaline","sulfadiazine-sulfamethoxazole","sulfadiazine-trimethoprim","sulafasalazine-sulfaguanindine"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":55,"q":"高劑量給予低溶解度的磺胺劑sulfathiazole所產生之主要不良反應為何？","opts":["結晶尿","過敏性胃腸炎","甲狀腺功能低下","低凝血酶元血症"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":56,"q":"青黴素類抗生素抗菌活性的破壞，通常發生於其化學構造上的那一個位置被裂解之後所造成？","opts":["醯胺鍵","β-內醯胺環","羰基連接","羧基連接"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":57,"q":"青黴素類抗生素之作用機制主要為抑制細菌那一成分之功能？","opts":["DNA gyrase","RNA polymerase","thymidylate synthase","transpeptidase"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":58,"q":"下列那一藥物屬於長效型青黴素類製劑，單一次肌肉注射後其吸收可以維持48~72小時？","opts":["benzathine penicillin G","procaine penicillin G","benzylpenicillin","ampicillin"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":59,"q":"第一代頭孢菌素類（cephalosporins）藥物經吸收後，下列那一組織無法滲入？","opts":["尿液","乳液","皮下組織","腦脊髓液"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":60,"q":"長時間或高劑量使用頭孢菌素類（cephalosporins）藥物，對動物最可能產生之不良反應為何？","opts":["腎結晶尿","中樞神經性痙攣","神經肌肉連接阻斷","骨髓抑制"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":61,"q":"下列那一藥物注射給藥後對腦脊髓液之穿透力最好？","opts":["cephalexin","aztreonem","gentamicin","azithromycin"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":62,"q":"Aminoglycosides引起之神經肌肉阻斷不良反應，與抑制神經突觸下列何者的釋出較有關？","opts":["serotonin","catecholamine","epinephrine","acetylcholine"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":63,"q":"Lincosamides易造成下列那一動物腹瀉，因而限制使用？","opts":["牛","馬","貓","豬"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":64,"q":"由長春花（periwinkle）植物中萃取得到的抗腫瘤藥物是：","opts":["paclitaxel","etoposide","irinotecan","vinblastine"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":65,"q":"下列何種抗腫瘤藥物結構類似葉酸？","opts":["mechlorethamine","methotrexate","mitoxantrone","mitotane"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":66,"q":"下列何者不屬於aminoglycoside類抗生素？","opts":["apramycin","tobramycin","paromomycin","tulathromycin"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":67,"q":"飼料中若葉酸添加劑量過高，則會降低下列何種藥物的抗菌效果？","opts":["aminoglycosides","sulfonamides","licosamides","tetracyclines"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":68,"q":"下列何者可用於治療犬隻之G（+）所引起的牙周病及新孢子蟲病（neosporosis）？","opts":["clindamycin","erythromycin","methicillin","tylosin"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":69,"q":"下列何者不是用於治療犬毛囊蟲症？","opts":["ivermectin","amitraz","famotidine","doramectin"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":70,"q":"臨床上，鸚鵡嗉囊分離出念珠菌，下列何者不是治療用藥？","opts":["flucytosine","nystatin","ketoconazole","gemcitabine"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":71,"q":"下列何者為azoles類抗黴菌機制？","opts":["藉由結合真菌原生質體膜麥角固醇，因而改變細胞的滲透性","藉由結合真菌微管防止主軸的形成而抑制有絲分裂","藉由結合真菌的thymidylate synthase，抑制DNA合成","藉由阻斷細胞素P450酵素抑制麥角固醇的合成，因而提高細胞的滲透性"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":72,"q":"Azithromycin可用於治療下列何種疾病？","opts":["耳疥癬","隱孢子蟲症","山羊蟯蟲症","豬鉤頭蟲症"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":73,"q":"糞便檢出馬蛔蟲（Parascaris sp.）蟲卵，可用下列何者驅除之？","o